Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:15.73,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,The duel between the queen, Claire Harvey,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:18.95,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,and the new student, \NKisaragi Hayato, shall begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:22.18,Main Dialogue,Noa,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-kun is doing this for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.16,Main Dialogue,Liu,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't get yourself hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.71,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I will explain the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:28.39,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,The time limit will be fifteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:31.19,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,The match will end when\Na combatant is knocked out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:33.84,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,or when their energy runs out\Nand they're disarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:38.98,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy, I would like \Nto declare one thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:39.85,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:44.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I will not use full-body \Narmament in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:46.69,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Full-body armament?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:50.33,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A fighting tactic that only\Na few people at this school can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:55.49,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It releases a weapon's energy all at once\Nand allows the wielder to use its full capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.36,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The fight would be over in a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:01:00.74,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,and that wouldn't be fair \Nto our audience today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:04.46,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,She's saying she's going to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:06.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:08.75,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I'll act as your support, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.50,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Use our plan to win, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.01,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:17.41,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,it's against the rules to \Nreceive help during a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:19.29,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind, Erica.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:24.22,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,He's a new student here. \NI'll permit it as a handicap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:29.26,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:30.69,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:31.69,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:33.40,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:34.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:34.69,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Six...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:36.17,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Five...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:37.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,show me how strong you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:37.68,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:39.12,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:39.70,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:40.44,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:41.58,Main Dialogue Top,Bg,0000,0000,0000,,One...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:46.50,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:47.37,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.88,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:01:58.97,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:35.56,Episode Title,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The Invincible {\c&H0303C1&}Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:33.66,Main Dialogue Top,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,J-J-Just
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:35.98,Main Dialogue Top,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,wh-where do you think you're touching?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:46.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0045,,S-Sorry! I'm still not able to control \Nmy powers that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:48.29,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0045,,Could you forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0045,,Not likely, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:53.00,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.99,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I've never had anyone \Ntouch my ch-chest before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:58.25,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:02.09,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,h-had the gall to fondle me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.66,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Aliceterion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:15.06,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Energy barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.82,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It seems you're at least \Na little bit capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.95,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Emile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:27.86,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you have to grab \Nthe president's boobs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:28.91,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:31.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you getting mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.17,0:04:33.37,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:37.96,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,We failed with our initial plan, \Nbut our plan of attack isn't incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.20,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Try to charge in again, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:40.92,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:48.14,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:49.63,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:52.26,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, use the other move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.01,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:58.62,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:04:59.61,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.32,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,All that training wasn't for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:12.83,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:22.59,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That was more than I expected, \NKisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.30,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It was worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:28.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,However, this is the finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:37.52,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.44,Main Dialogue,Liu,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.44,Flashback Dialogue,Noa,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:45.64,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I think we can see \Nthe outcome of this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:47.15,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Do you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:50.82,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,N-Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:52.33,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.83,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That's the spirit. And \NI shall respond in kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.00,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,The Buster Cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.80,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,She's going to use it against a new student?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.12,Italics Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:15.35,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,You can't, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:17.88,Italics Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Hayato! Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.86,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.39,Italics Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Can you hear me, Hayato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:21.31,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,My body's so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:26.24,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This is the end, Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:40.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What's going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:42.87,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,His movements have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.38,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,The president is being pushed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.42,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.55,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,But at this distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.05,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A full-body armament...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,And he's deploying an N-Barrier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:03.89,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:07.19,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato has only had \Nhis Hundred for two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:08.61,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:11.70,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:18.05,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I am the perfect queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:21.00,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I can't lose here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.27,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Petal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:42.56,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:46.94,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This is the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:48.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:20.81,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:30.87,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.49,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:35.36,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,You said you weren't going to use \Nyour full-body armament!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:36.87,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second, Emile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:39.52,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,The declaration she made
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.97,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,had nothing to do with the rules of a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.53,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.79,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,I know what you want to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:49.50,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,but this match was won by Claire Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:54.60,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,No, I lost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:59.06,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I won under the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:01.60,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I lost to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:07.48,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about we leave it\Nas a tie in the official record?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.29,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Where... am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:25.34,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:28.27,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato... Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.51,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:30.83,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.02,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.68,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Have you come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:41.63,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:46.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I see... I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:49.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Then Emile and the girls \Nare still getting expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.36,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I canceled the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.37,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.42,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:58.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember anything \Nfrom halfway through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.48,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:04.46,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.67,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:08.16,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,In your first duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.19,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,you used a full-body armament,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:11.75,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,and deployed an N-Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.41,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You managed to corner me, the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:16.23,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That shouldn't normally be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:17.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:20.42,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't know, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:22.76,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.34,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,What's the meaning of this, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:29.61,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Are you still trying to do \Nsomething to Hayato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:30.02,Main Dialogue Top,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Emile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:32.84,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I just came to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.03,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:40.55,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:42.61,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:45.04,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:49.00,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. I'm just glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:56.02,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't let it get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:57.52,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,If it had been a normal duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:00.13,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,you would have won hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:03.41,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I'm thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.40,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then are you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:08.97,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,bothered by the fact that you\Nhad your b-b-boobs touched?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:09.39,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Wh—?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:13.04,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:13.90,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Erica,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:18.01,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama isn't someone to get worked up \Nbecause someone grabbed her boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:19.15,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but Liddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:23.66,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,even I haven't touched Claire-sama's \Nsublime boobs for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:26.16,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's enough about boobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:28.16,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:38.33,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. It looks like you're fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:40.80,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.26,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:45.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm pretty hungry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:46.66,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.29,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:52.48,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,When you use a lot of energy, \Nyou get hungry, supposedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:53.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:58.54,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hayato, do you want to go to Central?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:00.63,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,We have today off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.49,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Central?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:04.20,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,It's the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0}'s business district.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.60,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure there are a lot of places to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:09.65,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.65,0:12:10.87,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:13.07,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:15.54,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really want to go Central that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:19.09,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it! I wanted to go on\Na date with you that badly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:26.22,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So this is Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:29.03,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn't think we were on a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:30.34,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Emile?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Are we kind of standing out for some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:35.23,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,It's not us, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:38.48,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone was watching yesterday's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:39.88,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:41.99,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.99,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:45.83,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.58,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:51.20,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty good, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.36,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:57.18,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have some of yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:58.60,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:01.00,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Yum! Strawberry's pretty good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:01.89,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:04.66,Main Dialogue,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-kun and Crossfode-kun \Nare pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.03,Main Dialogue,R,0000,0000,0000,,Kind of makes you wonder, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.93,Main Dialogue,R2,0000,0000,0000,,They're in the same dorm room, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:08.81,Main Dialogue,R3,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:11.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Emile, let's go get some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:13.47,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anywhere will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:18.23,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, but before that,\Nthere's one place I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:23.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.39,0:13:26.16,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Cool, isn't it, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.80,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:29.76,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:35.25,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This is unmistakably a date spot, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:39.05,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to come here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.38,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I heard it had a\N great view of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:43.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:45.22,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:46.59,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:56.52,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently it gets even more\Nromantic at sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:58.68,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.52,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.28,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.34,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.28,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Nii-san, why didn't you tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:09.03,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,about the duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.89,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I just didn't want you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:16.29,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's talking about you \Nhere at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:20.50,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,So I wanted to see what happened \Nwhen I did some fortune telling,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:23.32,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,and there was an ominous shadow \Nof a woman that came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:27.83,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Are you with a girl right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.68,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:30.60,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.01,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Are you telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:34.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:36.64,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Then can I check?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:40.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:45.03,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think you'd actually come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.14,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I got permission to go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:52.07,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you supposed to be alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:56.03,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well, I said I wasn't with a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:57.81,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but I didn't say I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:59.92,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you, Karen-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.46,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Emile Crossfode, Hayato's roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:06.55,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,You're male, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.94,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:11.13,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.33,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:15.72,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,...like other men?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:17.31,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.11,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,So you two are really just roommates, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:26.60,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,You're not trying to seduce \Nmy brother or something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:28.10,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:31.52,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I? I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:35.37,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I'll leave it at that for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:39.26,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,but I won't forgive you if you try \Nto do something to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:41.25,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Roar. Roar roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:44.25,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:45.25,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:48.99,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's the idol, Kirishima Sakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:51.26,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I listened to her songs \Nin the hospital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:53.95,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,She's really popular right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:55.76,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:59.27,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,They're calling her the Diva of the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:03.94,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,There's supposed to be an outdoor concert \Non the Zwei Island chain today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.90,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,The Zwei Islands are pretty close \Nto our current position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:09.28,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.65,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:13.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.78,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.92,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah! I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:21.06,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,What should we get for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.29,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Nii-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:25.54,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I have a place I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A place you want to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.84,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,The cafeteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:33.55,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I've always wanted to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.05,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,What should I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:39.90,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Salisbury steak, fried shrimp,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.03,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,potstickers, curry rice,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:44.36,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,stir-fried burdock, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.31,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you're going to get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.31,0:16:49.73,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,But everything on the menu looks good...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:51.57,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell Miharu, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.57,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't finish it all, \NI'll eat it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:56.88,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:59.12,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to have Nii-san eat it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:16:59.74,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:04.69,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,This is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.03,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,The food at the hospital is good, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:09.10,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,but this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:13.15,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,You can have some of my \Npasta too, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:19.60,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.86,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:25.43,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,B-But this isn't enough to\Nget on my good side, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:27.26,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.48,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:33.09,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:34.49,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,President?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:38.44,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,So that blonde with the drills is the one \Nwho put you through all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.44,Main Dialogue Top,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.12,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I already heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.29,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that rude girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:45.49,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, this is my...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.49,0:17:47.26,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,She's Kisaragi Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.75,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-sama's little sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.21,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.05,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.89,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,I am Claire-sama's assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:59.06,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Chris Steinbelt, middle school second-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:02.46,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:04.21,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This is good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:06.65,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I actually have something \Nto talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:08.73,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Something to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:09.98,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:13.73,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to help out the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:14.73,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.25,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:19.23,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Why does Hayato have to help out with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:22.41,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,The duel yesterday should have \Nbeen settled with that tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.67,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,There's no obligation for him \Nto do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:25.62,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.46,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it's not compulsory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.92,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,He's simply being recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:30.81,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.81,0:18:32.22,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.35,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I would like you to join Selections,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.97,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,a special unit under the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.55,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Selections?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:44.80,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,You would follow orders from Warslarn HQ,\Nwho manage the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:49.78,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,You would remain a student but execute\Nmissions like a full-fledged Slayer would.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:53.52,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,The missions would include the guarding \Nof various facilities, bodyguard duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.83,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,and of course, actual combat with Savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Combat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:04.07,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Due to the Savage nest \Nelimination mission the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:06.17,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,we don't have enough Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:08.48,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,We require immediate reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:11.08,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Just as Liddy said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:13.33,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,this is not compulsory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:15.95,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,However, I believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.24,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,noblesse oblige!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:19.72,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Those with power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:23.72,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,should wield it \Nfor the sake of those without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:30.67,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't think I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:33.31,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Then I will join with Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You do not meet the requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:39.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You have to be able to\Nfight head-on with a Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:40.82,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Or you'd drag everyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:45.33,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,So, you want me to face\Nthe president in a duel, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:48.48,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,How disrespectful, Emile Crossfode!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:49.96,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,What can you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:52.64,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't have to be the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:55.82,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy Steinberg, I wouldn't mind\Ntaking you on either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:58.76,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,That should be enough \Nto show you my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:19:59.98,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.58,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,When do you want to have the duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:04.05,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I'm ready to go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.79,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.81,0:20:16.70,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A dragoon type?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:21.03,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Vice President... \Nare you in or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.09,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:24.99,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:34.51,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:35.95,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't stop me, Erica.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.55,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I need to put him in his place, \Nor it'll set a bad precedent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:42.24,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Now things are getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.18,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.17,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go off firing around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:46.53,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Karen's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:47.70,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:50.22,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:53.69,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,She changed the form of her armament?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:55.48,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:20:58.84,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:00.71,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,I'll stop you with force.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.03,0:21:02.55,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Let them continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:03.53,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:06.78,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.45,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you supposed to put me in my place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:14.30,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get so cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:24.51,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:25.55,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,An alert?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:28.06,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama, we have an order to sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:28.82,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:30.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Liddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:32.86,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.36,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,You got out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.08,Main Dialogue,Emil,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're going to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.29,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:41.25,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Something more important came up \Nthan fighting you. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:42.78,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.91,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:48.66,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We received word that the Savage \Nhave appeared on the Zwei Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:50.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,The Zwei Islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:53.16,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,The place where Sakura-san was to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:54.84,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:59.31,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come to get your response \Non joining Selections later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:01.35,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second, Claire Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:04.05,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Charlotte Dimandius!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:06.05,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Take them with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:07.67,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:11.96,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, looks like you'll be \Ngetting your first real battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:15.72,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready to participate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:20.94,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A real battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:24.79,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A real battle with the Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.96,0:24:05.87,Next Episode Title,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1)}Variant {\c&H0303C1&}Awakening
